stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> planned
  planned --> ready: dependencies and preconditions met
  ready --> running: first action claimed
  running --> passed: required assertions pass
  running --> receiver_failed: comparable assertion fails
  running --> environment_failed: required environment unavailable
  running --> ambiguous: unresolved possible send
  running --> unsupported: required capability absent
  running --> cancelled: cancelled
  running --> harness_failed: internal invariant fails
  passed --> [*]
  receiver_failed --> [*]
  environment_failed --> [*]
  ambiguous --> [*]
  unsupported --> [*]
  cancelled --> [*]
  harness_failed --> [*]
